<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech 13wk CNB bills gross 12.4pct, undersubscribed.</title>
<headline>Czech 13wk CNB bills gross 12.4pct, undersubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The gross yield in an auction of five billion crowns in the Czech National Bank's 13-week liquidity bills was 12.4 percent and the Dutch auction was undersubscribed, the CNB said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Bids totalled 1.76 billion crowns, it said.</p>
<p>Gross yield in the last auction of similar bills was 12.75 percent on January 9.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
